# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout. rustfmt is
# configured with newline_style = "Unix", so a CRLF working tree (which
# core.autocrlf = true produces on Windows) makes `cargo fmt --check` -- the
# Stop gate's first command -- fail on files it would otherwise accept. Forcing
# eol=lf keeps the gate meaningful across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pixhaus binary
